sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SP as Service Provider
    actor Client as Founder / Entrepreneur
    participant UI as Next.js (/services, /workroom)
    participant PPC as ProfessionalProfilesController
    participant SLC as ServiceListingsController
    participant CBC as ClientBriefsController
    participant WEC as WorkroomEngagementsController
    participant CC as ContractsController
    participant InvC as InvoicesController
    participant DB as MongoDB Collections

    Note over SP,DB: Phase 1: Provider Onboarding & Profile
    SP->>UI: Create Professional / Provider Profile
    UI->>PPC: POST /api/professionalprofiles
    PPC->>DB: Write ProfessionalProfiles & ServiceProviderProfiles

    Note over SP,DB: Phase 2: Catalog Publishing
    SP->>UI: Create Service Package (Pricing, Scope, Milestones)
    UI->>SLC: POST /api/servicelistings
    SLC->>DB: Write ServiceListings (Status: Published)

    Note over Client,DB: Phase 3: Brief Submission & Matching
    Client->>UI: Submit Client Brief / Project Need
    UI->>CBC: POST /api/clientbriefs
    CBC->>DB: Write ClientBriefs
    Client->>UI: Select Service Listing or Invite Provider
    Client->>CBC: POST /api/clientbriefs/{id}/proposals

    Note over SP,DB: Phase 4: Engagement & Workroom
    Client->>UI: Accept Proposal & Initiate Workroom
    UI->>WEC: POST /api/workroomengagements
    WEC->>DB: Create WorkroomEngagements record
    WEC->>DB: Initialize Workroom Activities & Milestones

    Note over Client,DB: Phase 5: Contract & Escrow
    Client->>UI: Generate Contract from Workroom
    UI->>CC: POST /api/contracts
    CC->>DB: Write Contracts (Milestones, IP transfer clauses)
    Client->>CC: POST /api/contracts/{id}/sign
    SP->>CC: POST /api/contracts/{id}/sign

    Note over SP,DB: Phase 6: Invoicing & Payout
    SP->>UI: Complete Milestone & Request Payment
    UI->>InvC: POST /api/invoices
    InvC->>DB: Write Invoices (Status: PendingApproval)
    Client->>InvC: POST /api/invoices/{id}/pay
    InvC->>DB: Update Invoices (Status: Paid)
    InvC->>DB: Update WorkroomEngagements / ProfessionalProfiles (Reputation score)
